 ref=\"2Kgs 4:31\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,31)\">2Kgs 4:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,6)\">Ezek 7:6</ref> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַהֲקיצ֫וֺתָ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Prov 6:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,22)\">Prov 6:22</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 1 singular <bdbheb>אָקִיץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 23:35\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,35)\">Prov 23:35</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>יָקִ֫יצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 51:39\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,39)\">Jer 51:39</ref> +; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>הָקִ֫יצָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 2:19\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,19)\">Hab 2:19</ref> +; masculine plural <bdbheb>הָקִ֫יצוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 26:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,19)\">Isa 26:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 1:5\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(29,1,5)\">Joel 1:5</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הָקִיץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 17:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,15)\">Ps 17:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 73:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,20)\">Ps 73:20</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מֵקִיץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 26:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,26,12)\">1Sam 26:12</ref> — <highlight>shew signs of waking, awake:</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> from sleep, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Sam 26:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,26,12)\">1Sam 26:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 29:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,8)\">Isa 29:8</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ps 3:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,3,6)\">Ps 3:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 73:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,20)\">Ps 73:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 139:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,18)\">Ps 139:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 6:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,22)\">Prov 6:22</ref> (doubtful line, see Toy). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 44:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,24)\">Ps 44:24</ref> <highlight>awake</highlight> [from sleep] to activity, so <ref ref=\"Ps 35:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,35,23)\">Ps 35:23</ref> (with <bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> of thing), <ref ref=\"Ps 59:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"59\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"59\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,59,6)\">Ps 59:6</ref> (c. infinitive purpose). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> from ecstatic sleep of prophets <ref ref=\"Jer 31:26\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,26)\">Jer 31:26</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> from sleep of death, with negative <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:31\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,31)\">2Kgs 4:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:39\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,39)\">Jer 51:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:57\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"57\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"57\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,57)\">Jer 51:57</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 14:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv